  "prototypeNotes": [
    "Race, Auspice, and Tribe are required Character creation classifications owned entirely by the Werewolf package.",
    "Rank is system-assigned as Cliath during standard Character creation.",
    "Classification changes use a preview-and-confirm policy because they may invalidate resources, Gifts, Backgrounds, Abilities, and Renown.",
    "The Black Furies eligibility statement is preserved but not mechanically enforced until semantic and product-policy review.",
    "No Chronicle Core type assumes the existence of Race, Auspice, Tribe, or Cliath."
  ]
